  "de": "Cho $\\dfrac{1}{a}+\\dfrac{1}{b}+\\dfrac{1}{c}=1$ và $\\dfrac{1}{a^2}+\\dfrac{1}{b^2}+\\dfrac{1}{c^2}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$.\nTính $M = \\dfrac{1}{ab}+\\dfrac{1}{bc}+\\dfrac{1}{ca}$",
